      "body": "SELECT \n  d.name::text as department,  -- Explicitly cast to text\n  COALESCE(SUM(p.budget_amount), 0)::numeric as total_budget\nFROM departments d\nLEFT JOIN projects p ON d.id = p.department_id \nGROUP BY d.id, d.name\nHAVING COALESCE(SUM(p.budget_amount), 0) > 0\nORDER BY total_budget DESC",
